flowchart TD
  Submit[Developer publishes PR and requests both reviews] --> Reviews[Lead technical and Designer game identity decisions]
  Reviews --> Decision{Both approve this head?}
  Decision -->|Changes requested| Fix[Developer owns concrete corrections]
  Fix --> NewHead[New head receives proportionate delta reviews]
  NewHead --> Reviews
  Decision -->|Review pending| Owner[Lead follows up named reviewer]
  Owner --> Reviews
  Decision -->|Yes| Checks{Required checks pass and head unchanged?}
  Checks -->|Failure| Repair[Author fixes current change or owner resolves infrastructure]
  Repair --> NewHead
  Checks -->|Yes| Merge[Lead merges with expected head guard]
  Merge --> Verify[Read back merge and dispatch next work]
  Decision -->|Conflicting requirements| Resolve[Lead and Designer reconcile accepted outcome]
  Resolve -->|Resolved| Fix
  Resolve -->|Human decision genuinely required| Human[Ask one precise question and record affected scope]
  Human --> Resolve
  Owner -.-> Other[Independent ready work continues]
  Repair -.-> Other
  Human -.-> Other
